.atl/
prd_web_datos_economicos_v2 (1).md

# Local secrets. `env.example` is the committed reference; `.env` holds the
# real POSTGRES_PASSWORD and must never be committed.
.env
.env.*
!env.example

# Local Compose overrides. Compose merges this file into
# docker-compose.yml automatically, which is exactly why it must not be
# committed: docker-compose.yml is the PRODUCTION topology and publishes no
# ports to the host, and a committed override would silently re-publish
# them on every deploy made from a checkout. docker-compose.override.yml.example
# is the committed template — copy it, do not track the copy.
/docker-compose.override.yml
/docker-compose.override.yaml

# Local backup output from scripts/backup/pg_dump.sh
/backups/

# The export artifact the ingest-export-build job hands from its Go half to
# its astro-build half (.github/workflows/ingest-export-build.yml's
# EXPORT_ARTIFACT_DIR). Machine-generated, regenerated on every run, and
# reproduced at this same path when the job is run locally.
/.e2e-export-artifact/

# Page snapshots and traces written by the Playwright MCP server
/.playwright-mcp/

# Screenshots dropped at the repo root by a relative-path MCP capture. The
# server's own output directory above is the intended destination; this is the
# safety net for the times a bare filename is passed instead.
/*.png
# Test residue: schedule_integration_test.go exercises the scheduler's publish
# step, which resolves its static root through serve.go's RELATIVE "web/dist"
# default — so the artifact lands inside the package directory rather than in a
# t.TempDir(). Ignored rather than committed; the test recreates it on every run.
/app/cmd/concontexto/web/
